@BookingManagement.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5159

### Health check
GET {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Health/CheckIfLive

### Create a booking
POST {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "room-1",
  "userId": "user-1",
  "startDateTime": "2026-02-02T10:00:00Z",
  "endDateTime": "2026-02-02T11:00:00Z"
}

### Create a booking that starts when the previous one ends (allowed)
POST {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "room-1",
  "userId": "user-2",
  "startDateTime": "2026-02-02T11:00:00Z",
  "endDateTime": "2026-02-02T12:00:00Z"
}

### Create an overlapping booking (409 Conflict)
POST {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "room-1",
  "userId": "user-3",
  "startDateTime": "2026-02-02T10:30:00Z",
  "endDateTime": "2026-02-02T11:30:00Z"
}

### Bookings of a resource within a date range
GET {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/resources/room-1/bookings?from=2026-02-02T00:00:00Z&to=2026-02-03T00:00:00Z&page=1&pageSize=50

### Bookings of a resource including the cancelled ones
GET {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/resources/room-1/bookings?includeCancelled=true

### Audit log
GET {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20

### Audit log of a single booking
GET {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audit-logs?bookingId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get a single booking
GET {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Cancel a booking
POST {{BookingManagement.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
